# Development usage/trial logs (inside the repo for easy evaluation)
# Use .system/usage-logs/ + DEVSPAN_LOG_FILE when you want logs to travel with the checkout.
# TRIAL-log.md holds real-task rows that may reference private work — never auto-committed.
.system/TRIAL-log.md
.system/usage-logs/*.log
.system/usage-logs/*.jsonl
.system/usage-logs/*.log.*

# Chair overlay (local). Hosts do not auto-load these.
_status/
inbox/
PROTOCOL.md
_system/

